I wake up in the morning.
I get out of bed.
It is a little dark in the room.
I go near the window.
I pull the curtains aside.
There is a lot of light outside.
The sun is very bright.
Harsh light comes into the room.
I immediately feel very warm.
It is still only morning.
But there is a lot of sun outside.
Today is a very hot day.
I open the window.
The air outside is also warm.
It is very hot in Mumbai now.
I feel very thirsty.
I want cold water.
I go to the kitchen.
